  "description": "Reads and writes email, contact and calendar files. Outlook data files (PST and OST, ANSI, Unicode and 4K-page formats, with or without encryption): folders, messages, recipients, attachments, embedded messages, bodies (text, HTML, compressed RTF), MAPI and named properties, contacts, appointments with their recurrences, tasks and distribution lists. Email messages (EML, MIME): headers, addresses, encoded words, multiparts, attachments and embedded messages, kept byte for byte when unchanged. Outlook items (MSG) in compound files. TNEF streams (winmail.dat). Mailboxes: mbox, Maildir, Apple Mail (.emlx), Thunderbird summaries (.msf, Mork). Contacts and calendars: vCard 2.1, 3.0 and 4.0, iCalendar with time zones and recurrence rules, converted to and from Outlook items. Offline address books (OAB version 4). A common model to convert messages between the formats.",
